ta-delay=\"0\" data-animateDuration=\"0.8\" data-stagger=\"0\" data-ease=\"none\">\r\n    <h6 class=\"title-text\">Achievements &#038; Awards Winning<\/h6><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d362592 elementor-widget elementor-widget-alsha_text_editor\" data-id=\"d362592\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"alsha_text_editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"alsha-text-editor-el elementor-clearfix\">\n    <p>Design Excellence Award \u2014 2022<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c2a55f2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-alsha_text_editor\" data-id=\"c2a55f2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"alsha_text_editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"alsha-text-editor-el elementor-clearfix\">\n    <p>Recognized for outstanding architectural concepts that balance functionality, spatial clarity, and refined design execution.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-198b1d4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-alsha_text_editor\" data-id=\"198b1d4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"alsha_text_editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"alsha-text-editor-el elementor-clearfix\">\n    <p>International Architecture Recognition \u2014 2020<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a2b15af elementor-widget elementor-widget-alsha_text_editor\" data-id=\"a2b15af\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"alsha_text_editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"alsha-text-editor-el elementor-clearfix\">\n    <p>Awarded for innovative residential design integrating natural light, landscape, and sustainable materials.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a70c343 elementor-widget elementor-widget-alsha_text_editor\" data-id=\"a70c343\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"alsha_text_editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"alsha-text-editor-el elementor-clearfix\">\n    <p>Urban Design Contribution Award \u2014 2019<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d7e962 elementor-widget elementor-widget-alsha_text_editor\" data-id=\"1d7e962\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"alsha_text_editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"alsha-text-editor-el elementor-clearfix\">\n    <p>Honored for contributions to contemporary urban architecture and thoughtful spatial planning.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f99f864 elementor-widget elementor-widget-alsha_text_editor\" data-id=\"f99f864\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"alsha_text_editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"alsha-text-editor-el elementor-clearfix\">\n    <p>Featured Architect in Global Design Review \u2014 2018<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0a2bc6a elementor-widget elementor-widget-alsha_text_editor\" data-id=\"0a2bc6a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"alsha_text_editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"alsha-text-editor-el elementor-clearfix\">\n    <p>Selected among emerging architects shaping modern residential architecture.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Alexander Moore Founder &amp; Principal Architect Alexander believes architecture should quietly support everyday life while maintaining a strong and timeless design language. His approach balances spatial functionality, natural light, and material simplicity to create environments that feel both refined and enduring. English \/ French \/ German alexander.moore@alshaarchitects.com (+44) 20-8456-329 Areas of Expertise Architectural Concept Development [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-2401","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/demo.7iquid.com\/alsha\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2401","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/demo.7iquid.com\/alsha\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/demo.7iquid.com\/alsha\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/demo.7iquid.com\/alsha\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/demo.7iquid.com\/alsha\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2401"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/demo.7iquid.com\/alsha\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2401\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":6374,"href":"https:\/\/demo.7iquid.com\/alsha\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2401\/revisions\/6374"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/demo.7iquid.com\/alsha\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2401"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}